# IPv4/IPv6 tooltips
msgid "IPv4: DNSBL (9 blacklist) + PTR reverse DNS. For GeoIP and WHOIS use the DNS & IP Tools tab."
msgstr "IPv4: DNSBL (9 blacklist) + PTR reverse DNS. Per GeoIP e WHOIS usa la scheda DNS e Strumenti IP."

msgid "IPv6: PTR reverse DNS only. DNSBL checks are not available (only 1 of 9 blacklists supports IPv6). For GeoIP and WHOIS use the DNS & IP Tools tab."
msgstr "IPv6: solo PTR reverse DNS. I controlli DNSBL non sono disponibili (solo 1 blacklist su 9 supporta IPv6). Per GeoIP e WHOIS usa la scheda DNS e Strumenti IP."

